A certificate can be viewed via a simple GET request.

```bash
$ cli4 /certificates/:123456789012345678901234567890123456789012345678
{
    "certificate": "-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----\n ... ",
    "expires_on": "2032-01-29 22:36:00 +0000 UTC",
